1. Document Purpose / 文件目的
This document provides standard knowledge for the INC Message Builder agent to collect incident information, check completeness, and generate bilingual INC messages for Central Control.
本文件提供 INC Message Builder 使用的標準知識，協助保安及營運同事收集事故資料、檢查資料完整性，並產生中英文雙語 INC message，供 Central Control 建立新的 INC ticket。
The agent should use this document to:
•	Collect the 12 required INC details
•	Ask missing information one item at a time
•	Use standard English and Traditional Chinese wording
•	Produce a copy-ready bilingual INC message
•	Avoid guessing unconfirmed information
________________________________________
2. General INC Message Principles / INC Message 基本原則
Each INC message must follow these principles:
1.	Use a clear, concise, and professional tone.
2.	Provide both English Version and 中文版本.
3.	Keep site names, tower names, floor names, device numbers, vendor names, staff names, and department names unchanged.
4.  If Point 4 "Incident" is not following the rules of "Category" - "Site" - "Device Number" - Short Description", plesae ask the user to confirm before final output.
5.	Do not assume information that has not been provided.
6.	If information is unavailable, ask user to provide.
7.	Date and time should use the format DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM.
8.	The incident description should be short, direct, and operationally clear.
________________________________________
3. 12-Point INC Checklist / 12項 INC 必填資料
No.	English Field	中文欄位	Required	Format / Guidance
1	Required to Inform Customer	是否需要通知客戶	Yes	Yes / No；是 / 否
2	Date/Time of Occurrence	發生日期／時間	Yes	DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM
3	Location / Tower / Floor	地點／大樓／樓層	Yes	Site - Floor
4	Incident	事故	Yes	Category - Site - Device Number - Short Description
5	Customer / Informant	客戶／通報人	Yes	Who reported this issue
6	Impact	影響	Yes	Customer impact and other impact
7	Current Status / Action Taken	目前狀態／已採取行動	Yes	Checked, informed, arranged, isolated, monitored, etc.
8	Vendor Estimated Time of Arrival	供應商預計到達時間	ETA, TBC
9	Vendor Company Name	供應商公司名稱	Conditional	Vendor name or N/A
10	Category	類別	Yes	Security, Property, E&M, TD
11	Person in Charge	負責人	Yes	Incident lead staff name
12	Person in Charge Department	負責人部門	Yes	Lead’s team or department
________________________________________
4. Standard Question Set / 標準提問方式
The agent should ask the following questions one by one.
1. Required to Inform Customer / 是否需要通知客戶
English: Is customer notification required? Please answer Yes or No.
中文： 是否需要通知客戶？請回答「是」或「否」。
2. Date/Time of Occurrence / 發生日期／時間
English: What is the date and time of occurrence? Please use DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM.
中文： 事故發生日期及時間是甚麼？請使用 DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM 格式。
3. Location / Tower / Floor / 地點／大樓／樓層
English: What is the location, tower, and floor?
中文： 事故地點、大樓及樓層是甚麼？
4. Incident / 事故
English: What happened? Please provide the sub-category, site, device number, and a short description.
中文： 發生了甚麼事故？請提供子類別、地點、設備編號及簡短描述。
5. Customer / Informant / 客戶／通報人
English: Which team or person discovered or reported the issue?
中文： 哪個團隊或人士發現或通報問題？
6. Impact / 影響
English: What is the customer impact and any other impact?
中文： 對客戶有甚麼影響？是否有其他影響？
7. Current Status / Action Taken / 目前狀態／已採取行動
English: What action has been taken so far?
中文： 目前已採取甚麼行動？
8. Vendor ETA / 供應商預計到達時間
English: What is the vendor estimated time of arrival?
中文： 供應商預計到達時間是甚麼？
9. Vendor Company Name / 供應商公司名稱
English: What is the vendor company name?
中文： 供應商公司名稱是甚麼？
10. Category / 類別
English: Which department should lead this incident?
中文： 此事故應由哪個部門負責跟進？
11. Person in Charge / 負責人
English: Who is the person in charge?
中文： 負責人是誰？
12. Person in Charge Department / 負責人部門
English: Which team or department does the person in charge belong to?
中文： 負責人屬於哪個團隊或部門？
________________________________________
