6. Standard Wording Library / 標準用語庫
6.1 Customer Impact / 客戶影響
Situation	English Wording	中文寫法
No customer impact	No customer impact reported at this moment.	暫時未收到客戶受影響報告。
Access affected	Customer access is affected.	客戶出入受到影響。
Service affected	Service is affected.	服務受到影響。
Partial impact	Partial area is affected.	部分範圍受到影響。
Under checking	Impact is under checking.	影響情況仍在確認中。
6.2 Action Taken / 已採取行動
Situation	English Wording	中文寫法
Site checked	Security team checked the area.	保安團隊已檢查現場。
Vendor contacted	Vendor has been contacted for follow-up.	已聯絡供應商跟進。
Warning notice placed	Warning notice has been placed on site.	現場已放置提示告示。
Area cordoned	Affected area has been cordoned off.	受影響範圍已圍封。
Monitoring	Security team will continue to monitor the situation.	保安團隊會繼續監察情況。
6.3 Vendor ETA / 供應商 ETA
Situation	English Wording	中文寫法
ETA confirmed	Vendor ETA is DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM.	供應商預計到達時間為 DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM。
Waiting for ETA	Vendor ETA is pending.	供應商預計到達時間待確認。
Vendor not required	Vendor attendance is not required at this stage.	現階段無需供應商到場。
